    "#REFLECTION: Milestone 2 Evaluation \n",
    "\n",
    "1 Which type of emails were hardest to classify?\n",
    "Emails that used polite or neutral language but implied urgency were the hardest to classify. For example, reminder emails with soft wording but strict deadlines were difficult for the rule-based system to interpret correctly.\n",
    "\n",
    "2 Why did your rules fail in some cases?\n",
    "The rules failed because they rely mainly on keyword matching and cannot fully understand context or intent. Some emails expressed urgency or required action without using explicit keywords, which caused incorrect classification.\n",
